
### ============================================
### AUTH
### ============================================

### Register user
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0966111714",
  "password": "ownerpass123"
}
### Register user
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "09661111134",
  "password": "ownerpass123"
}

### Register second user
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0966222255",
  "password": "driverpass123"
}

### Login (use instead of register if these numbers are already taken)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0966111714",
  "password": "ownerpass123"
}

### Refresh token
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken":"PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}


### JWT security check — an ACCESS token must NOT be accepted as a refresh token
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### JWT security check — a REFRESH token must NOT authenticate an API request
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles/my
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE


### ============================================
### FLEET — vehicle accounts
### ============================================

### User creates a vehicle account
### Paste creator's accessToken below
POST http://localhost:8080/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "plateNumber": "AA-70999",
  "vehicleType": "MINIBUS",
  "capacity": 12
}

### Get all vehicles I'm a member of
### Paste any member's accessToken below
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles/my
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Vehicle member invites another user by phone number
### Paste a vehicle member's token and the vehicle id below
POST http://localhost:8080/vehicles/1/members/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE



{
  "phoneNumber": "0966222252"
}

### Invited user accepts the invitation
### Paste invited user's token and the invitation id below
POST http://localhost:8080/vehicles/invitations/5/accept
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE


### ============================================
### LOCATION — live tracking
### ============================================

### Send a GPS ping (must be a member AND vehicle must be ACTIVE)
### Paste vehicle member's token and the vehicle id below
POST http://localhost:8080/vehicles/1/location
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "latitude": 9.0192,
  "longitude": 38.7525,
  "speed": 24.5,
  "heading": 180.0
}

### Get the vehicle's live location (any authenticated user — passenger view)
### Paste any token and the vehicle id below
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles/1/location
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE



### Search nearby vehicles (any authenticated user — passenger view)
### Paste any token below. Coordinates are close to the test ping location.
GET http://localhost:8080/search/nearby?lat=9.02&lng=38.75&radiusMeters=2000
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
### Search nearby vehicles (any authenticated user — passenger view)
### Paste any token below. Coordinates are close to the test ping location.
GET http://localhost:8080/search/nearby?lat=9.02&lng=38.75&radiusMeters=2000
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE


POST http://localhost:8080/vehicles/1/location
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE


{
  "latitude": 9.0192,
  "longitude": 38.7525,
  "speed": 24.5,
  "heading": 180.0
}





### ============================================
### VEHICLE STATUS SECURITY CHECKS
### ============================================
### ACTIVE is the only status allowed to publish/serve live location.
### For now new vehicles are ACTIVE automatically because verification/admin approval
### is not built yet. To manually test INACTIVE behavior in development, change a
### vehicle status in PostgreSQL and then retry the location/search requests above.
### Expected for POST /vehicles/{id}/location when INACTIVE/UNDER_MAINTENANCE: 403
### Expected for GET /vehicles/{id}/location when INACTIVE/UNDER_MAINTENANCE: 404
### Expected for /search/nearby: that vehicle is omitted.


### ============================================
### VEHICLE INVITATIONS — inbox + decline checks
### ============================================

### List pending invitations addressed to the logged-in user's phone number
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles/invitations/my
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_INVITED_USER_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Decline a pending invitation
POST http://localhost:8080/vehicles/invitations/5/decline
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_INVITED_USER_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Duplicate pending invitation check
### Send the same vehicle + phone invitation twice.
### First request: 201 Created
### Second request while the first remains PENDING: 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/vehicles/1/members/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_VEHICLE_MEMBER_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "phoneNumber": "0966222252"
}

### Existing-member invitation check
### If the phone number already belongs to a VehicleMember for vehicle 1: 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/vehicles/1/members/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_VEHICLE_MEMBER_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "phoneNumber": "PASTE_EXISTING_MEMBER_PHONE_HERE"
}
